[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0010","text":"哈啊……哈啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0020","text":"（好厉害，巡……！\n　这势头简直要把摄像机甩掉了……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0030","text":"（还有几分钟来着……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0040","text":"（任务，来得及吗……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0050","text":"（──不对。要让它来得及……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0060","text":"（因为是真乃和灯织交给我的啊）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0070","text":"（不能在这里结束！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0080","text":"（一定要三个人一起迎接后夜祭……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0090","text":"（冲啊，巡……！！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0091","text":"校内广播"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0100","text":"“剩余时间——”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0110","text":"……我……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0120","text":"——我……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02030000_04_0130","text":"————我是……"}]
